## 2. Setup (use Next.js defaults)

From the repo root:

```bash
npx create-next-app@latest frontend --yes
```

Accept the **default** options (TypeScript, ESLint, Tailwind CSS, App Router, Turbopack, `@/*` import alias). **Do not restructure the project** away from what the defaults generate. If the defaults put code under `src/`, keep using `src/`; otherwise use the root `app/`. All paths below are relative to wherever `app/` lives.

Then install:

```bash
cd frontend
npx shadcn@latest init        # accept defaults; base color: neutral; CSS variables: yes
npm i recharts @tanstack/react-query zod react-hook-form @hookform/resolvers lucide-react clsx tailwind-merge date-fns
```

shadcn components to add as needed: `button input label select tabs dialog dropdown-menu sheet tooltip badge avatar progress switch checkbox form skeleton sonner table popover calendar`.

**Tailwind version note:** if the project uses **Tailwind v4**, define design tokens in `globals.css` with `@theme` / CSS variables. If it uses **v3**, use `tailwind.config.ts`. Detect which one is installed and follow it. Don't mix them.

Environment (`.env.local` and `.env.example`):
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000/api/v1/ws
NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_MOCKS=true
```

