## 3. Visual Design Language

**Match the attached reference image's style** (a soft dashboard UI). Reproduce the *look and feel*, **not** its content: no crypto, no logos, no brand names, no copied copy. All content is health data.

### What to capture from the reference
- **A rounded app "frame":** the whole app sits in a large dark rounded container on a soft pale-blue page background, with a **narrow dark icon sidebar** on the left and a **big white rounded main panel** on the right (generous inner padding).
- **Very rounded everything:** frame about 40px radius, main panel about 32px, cards about 24px, buttons/inputs/chips fully pill-shaped (`rounded-full`), icon buttons circular.
- **Pastel card colours** with dark text: lavender, mint, cream/butter, sky blue. Each domain card has its own pastel tint.
- **Bold, friendly geometric sans-serif** headings, with muted grey secondary text. Big numbers, small labels.
- **Soft, minimal chart:** thin light-blue line on a pale-blue gradient fill, a **dark pill tooltip** with a dot marker on the hovered point, tiny range tabs (`1W 1M 3M 6M 1Y ALL`) with the active one in bold.
- **One dark promo/CTA card** with a pill button in light blue and a subtle outlined decorative shape.
- **Clean table** with no heavy borders: small grey column headers, generous row height, rounded dark square icon tiles, coloured change figures, a star "watch" toggle.
- **Circular icon buttons** for search and notifications, with a small red dot for unread. A user chip (avatar + name + chevron) in the top right.
- Soft shadows only, no hard borders. Lots of whitespace.

### Design tokens (define as CSS variables / theme)
```
--page-bg:        #E4EFFB   /* pale blue page background */
--frame:          #1F1F21   /* dark rounded app frame + sidebar */
--panel:          #FFFFFF   /* main panel */
--ink:            #121212   /* primary text */
--muted:          #8A909C   /* secondary text */
--line:           #EEF1F5   /* hairlines, rare */

/* pastel surfaces */
--lavender:       #E7E0F4
--mint:           #DCF1E3
--cream:          #F8F0D4
--sky:            #DCEBFB
--chip:           #F1F4F9   /* neutral pill background */

/* accents */
--accent:         #BBDDFB   /* primary pill button */
--accent-ink:     #0F2A44
--good:           #3FAE6A   /* green */
--warn:           #D99A12   /* amber */
--bad:            #D9483B   /* red */
--violet:         #8A63C7   /* lavender accent text */
```
Flag level pastel backgrounds: green `--mint`, amber `--cream`, red a soft rose `#FBE3E0`, plus a matching darker text colour. **Never rely on colour alone:** always pair level with an icon and a text label ("Healthy", "Watch", "Needs attention").

**Radii:** `--r-frame: 40px; --r-panel: 32px; --r-card: 24px; --r-pill: 9999px`.
**Shadow:** `0 8px 30px rgba(20,40,80,.08)` for cards; `0 30px 80px rgba(20,40,80,.15)` for the frame.

**Typography:** load **Plus Jakarta Sans** via `next/font/google` (weights 400, 500, 600, 700, 800) for everything. Page titles 36 to 40px/800; section titles 22 to 24px/700; big numbers 32 to 40px/700; labels 12 to 14px/500 muted.

**Motion:** subtle only: 150 to 200ms ease-out for hover lift on cards, tab underline, tooltip fade, number count-up on load. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

**Dark mode:** the frame and sidebar are already dark. For dark mode, make the main panel `#17181B` with pastel cards switching to deeper tinted versions. This is **optional, last priority.**

